    "faq_home_6nkgUA": {
      "type": "faq-home",
      "blocks": {
        "question_EdMtQg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What tire brands does Prince Tires carry?",
            "answer": "<p>Prince Tires stocks a wide range of brands to fit every budget. We carry premium names like Michelin, Bridgestone, Firestone, BFGoodrich, Continental, General, Toyo, Yokohama, Kumho and Cooper, alongside value brands we import directly — Haida, Mileking, Rovelo and Cargomax trailer tires. Whether you need <a href='\/pages\/winter-tires-calgary'>winter tires<\/a>, <a href='\/pages\/all-weather-tires-calgary'>all-weather tires<\/a>, <a href='\/pages\/all-season-tires-calgary'>all-season tires<\/a>, or summer performance tires, we'll match you with the right brand for your vehicle and driving habits. Call either shop with your tire size and we'll tell you exactly what's on the shelf.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_MeiEVe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does a tire installation take?",
            "answer": "<p>A standard set of four takes about 45 to 60 minutes, including computer <a href='\/pages\/tire-balancing'>balancing<\/a>. Add <a href='\/pages\/tpms-calgary'>TPMS sensor work<\/a> and it's closer to 90 minutes. Booking an appointment guarantees your bay and lets us have your tires pulled before you arrive.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4WeWX3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need an appointment at Prince Tires?",
            "answer": "<p>We recommend booking an appointment to guarantee your tire service or purchase is completed during your visit. Appointments allow us to have the right tires ready and a bay reserved for your vehicle, so there's no waiting around. That said, walk-in customers are always welcome — we'll do our best to help you on the spot, but we can't guarantee same-visit availability without an appointment, especially during the October and November changeover rush. To book ahead, call 42 Ave SW at (403) 452-4283 or Edmonton Trail NE at (825) 395-4024, or schedule online through our website.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_9xBRnL": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What tire services does Prince Tires offer?",
            "answer": "<p>We handle everything tire-related so you can get back on the road quickly. Our services include new tire sales and <a href='\/pages\/tire-installation-calgary'>tire installation<\/a>, <a href='\/pages\/tire-balancing'>tire balancing<\/a>, <a href='\/pages\/tire-rotation'>tire rotation<\/a>, <a href='\/pages\/tire-repair-calgary'>flat tire repair<\/a>, and <a href='\/pages\/tpms-calgary'>TPMS (tire pressure monitoring system)<\/a> service. Every installation includes mounting, computer balancing, a valve stem check and torque to manufacturer spec — and we'll re-torque for free once you've driven on them. We're tire specialists, so we don't perform wheel alignment.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_jDYb6X": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why should I choose Prince Tires over other tire shops in Calgary?",
            "answer": "<p>We focus exclusively on tires and wheels, which means you're getting advice from specialists rather than a general repair shop fitting tires on the side. We stock a huge selection at every price point across two Calgary shops, install from $25 a tire with no surcharge on tires bought elsewhere, and price honestly. Calgary drivers have left us more than 560 Google reviews at a 4.9 average.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WMT7t6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you sell wheels and rims?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. In addition to tires, Prince Tires carries a wide selection of wheels and rims from brands like XF Off-Road, Armed, RTX, ENVY, and RSSW. Whether you're looking for rugged off-road wheels or sleek street rims, we'll help you find the right style and fitment for your vehicle. Call (403) 452-4283 or request a quote through our website to get started.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_locations": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where is Prince Tires located in Calgary?",
            "answer": "<p>We have two Calgary shops. Our main location is 111 42 Ave SW, Calgary, AB T2G 0A4 — call (403) 452-4283, open Mon–Thu & Sat 9:00am–5:00pm, Fri 9:00am–1:00pm and 2:30pm–5:00pm, Sunday 9:00am–2:00pm. Our second shop is Unit 101, 3928 Edmonton Trail NE, Calgary, AB T2E 3P6 — call (825) 395-4024, open Mon–Thu & Sat 9:00am–6:00pm, Fri 9:00am–1:00pm and 2:30pm–5:00pm, Sunday 9:00am–4:00pm. The 42 Ave SW location carries the larger inventory, so if you need a specific size today, start there. See <a href='\/pages\/locations'>both locations<\/a> for maps and directions.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_winter": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where can I buy winter tires in Calgary?",
            "answer": "<p>Right here at Prince Tires. Our guide to <a href='\/pages\/winter-tires-calgary'>winter tires Calgary<\/a> drivers actually need covers when to switch and what to spend, and you can <a href='\/collections\/winter-tires'>shop winter tires on sale<\/a> from about $130 per tire installed. Book early — the changeover rush runs mid-October to mid-November.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
